<% if (_status === 'submitted') { %>
Work Order Submitted — Review Required
========================================

A vendor has submitted a work order for request <%= request.mruid %>.
Your approval is required before they can begin work.

WORK ORDER DETAILS
------------------
Request #:     <%= request.mruid %>
Title:         <%= request.title %>
Estimated Cost: $<%= (workOrder.estimatedCostInCents / 100).toFixed(2) %>
Scope of Work: <%= workOrder.scope %>
<% if (workOrder.notes) { %>Notes:         <%= workOrder.notes %>
<% } %>
<% if (workOrder.lineItems && workOrder.lineItems.length > 0) { %>
LINE ITEMS
----------
<% workOrder.lineItems.forEach(function(item) { %>- <%= item.description %> | Qty: <%= item.quantity %> | $<%= (item.unitPriceInCents / 100).toFixed(2) %> each | Total: $<%= (item.amountInCents / 100).toFixed(2) %>
<% }); %>
<% } %>
Log in to the portal to approve or reject this work order.
<% } else if (_status === 'submitted_tenant') { %>
Work Order Submitted for Your Request
=======================================

The vendor assigned to your maintenance request <%= request.mruid %> has submitted a work order.
The property manager is reviewing it — no action is required from you at this time.

SUMMARY
-------
Request #:      <%= request.mruid %>
Title:          <%= request.title %>
Estimated Cost: $<%= (workOrder.estimatedCostInCents / 100).toFixed(2) %>
Scope:          <%= workOrder.scope %>

You'll receive another update once the work order is reviewed and the vendor is ready to begin.
<% } else if (_status === 'approved') { %>
Work Order Approved — Proceed with Job
========================================

Your work order for maintenance request <%= request.mruid %> has been approved.
You may now proceed with the work.

APPROVED WORK ORDER
-------------------
Request #:      <%= request.mruid %>
Title:          <%= request.title %>
Estimated Cost: $<%= (workOrder.estimatedCostInCents / 100).toFixed(2) %>
Scope:          <%= workOrder.scope %>
Approved By:    <%= approvedBy.firstName || approvedBy.email %>

Once the work is complete, submit your invoice through the portal to initiate payment.
<% } else if (_status === 'rejected') { %>
Work Order Rejected — Revision Required
=========================================

Your work order for maintenance request <%= request.mruid %> has been rejected.
Please review the feedback below and resubmit via the portal.

REJECTION DETAILS
-----------------
Request #:   <%= request.mruid %>
Title:       <%= request.title %>
Rejected By: <%= rejectedBy.firstName || rejectedBy.email %>
Reason:      <%= rejectionReason %>

Revise your work order to address the feedback above.
You can resubmit as long as the request remains in Assigned status.
<% } %>
